#. type: Title #
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using htmx for partial page reloads"
msgstr "Usando htmx para recarregar partes da página"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[htmx](https://htmx.org/) lets links and forms request HTML fragments and swap them into the current page. In a Yii\n"
"application, this works well for grids: sorting, filtering, and pagination can update only the grid while the rest of\n"
"the page stays in place.\n"
msgstr ""
"O [htmx](https://htmx.org/) permite que links e formulários requisitem fragmentos de HTML e os troquem na página atual. Em uma\n"
"aplicação Yii, isso funciona bem para grids: ordenação, filtros e paginação podem atualizar só o grid enquanto o resto\n"
"da página continua no lugar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
msgid "This recipe uses `GridView` as an example because it has links and forms that naturally benefit from partial reloads.  The same pattern works for any widget or page fragment: render the fragment separately, add htmx attributes to the controls that should refresh it, and return only that fragment for htmx requests."
msgstr "Esta receita usa o `GridView` como exemplo porque ele tem links e formulários que se beneficiam naturalmente de recargas parciais.  O mesmo padrão funciona para qualquer widget ou fragmento de página: renderize o fragmento separadamente, adicione atributos do htmx aos controles que devem atualizá-lo e retorne apenas esse fragmento nas requisições do htmx."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install GridView"
msgstr "Instale o GridView"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
msgid "Install the data view package if the application doesn't use it yet:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote de data view, se a aplicação ainda não o usa:"

#. type: Fenced code block (shell)
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "composer require yiisoft/yii-dataview\n"
msgstr "composer require yiisoft/yii-dataview\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load htmx"
msgstr "Carregue o htmx"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
msgid "The simplest setup is loading htmx from a CDN. Create `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/HtmxAsset.php`:"
msgstr "A configuração mais simples é carregar o htmx de uma CDN. Crie `src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/HtmxAsset.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/cookbook/using-htmx-for-partial-reloads.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
"\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetBundle;\n"
"\n"
"final class HtmxAsset extends AssetBundle\n"
"{\n"
"    public bool $cdn = true;\n"
"\n"
"    public array $js = [\n"
"        'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/htmx.org@2.0.10/dist/htmx.min.js',\n"
"    ];\n"
"\n"
"    public array $jsOptions = [\n"
"        'integrity' => 'sha384-H5SrcfygHmAuTDZphMHqBJLc3FhssKjG7w/CeCpFReSfwBWDTKpkzPP8c+cLsK+V',\n"
"        'crossorigin' => 'anonymous',\n"
"    ];\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"namespace App\\Web\\Shared\\Layout\\Main;\n"
